G101506</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">No change in Sprague Dawley rats;&#x02191; at low doses and no change at higher doses in Zuckerrats, with effects most evident on day 7 of a 14-day treatmentperiod [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B40">40</xref>]</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">No change in either Sprague Dawley or Zucker rats [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B40">40</xref>]</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></sec></back></article>